    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18972" root="سجل" body-key="s">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَجَلَ المَآءَ</span></b> , (S, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَجْلٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>He
poured out,</i> or <i>forth, the water,</i> (S, K, JM, TA,)
<i>continuously.</i> (JM, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Hence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَجَلَ القُرْآنَ</span>
<i>He read,</i> or <i>recited, the Kur-án continuously.</i>
(JM. [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَحَلَ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See also 2: ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  and 4.

